      { "element": "light/shaded-shadow cone around the circle", "role": "clearly shows this sketch concerns shadows, and that p2 resides in the shadow zone by the circle, so we would expect results that correlate with that fact"},
      { "element": "primary rays to p1 and p2 from the observer", "role": "emphasise that these points are being viewed, making the decision of whether the points are in shadow or not meaningful"}
